---
title: New game
sidebar:
  order: 3
---

These settings in `dx/config.h` decide where a new game starts:

```c
#define NEW_GAME_MAP_ID "kmr_20"
#define NEW_GAME_ENTRY_ID kmr_20_ENTRY_0
#define NEW_GAME_STORY_PROGRESS STORY_INTRO
```

| Setting | What it sets |
| --- | --- |
| `NEW_GAME_MAP_ID` | The map the player starts in |
| `NEW_GAME_ENTRY_ID` | The entry in that map where the player appears |
| `NEW_GAME_STORY_PROGRESS` | How far through the story the new game starts |
